{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spark Circuits VR</strong> is a touch-and-spark VR narrative adventure through the futuristic depths of a robot family\u2019s home. Overcome room puzzles and challenges by short circuiting the invasive robots while being mindful to not short circuit your helpful robot friend <i>Point One</i> or his little robot sister <i>Zeal</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring: </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full English voice acting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional subtitles </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Useful Save Spots </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three VR movement systems to choose from: slide, grapple teleport and/or arm swing </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A mini-plunger grapple for grabbing all those important items</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No AI was used in the creation of\u00a0<strong>Spark Circuits VR</strong>.\u00a0A text-to-speech voice program (because talking robots) was used to perform dialog written by a real life human person.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Note: this experience does have flashing lights</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1123820?t=1775182193","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123820/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1775182193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123820/14789c35e1913cdd37d6f5e4144ef44499043fba/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775182193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1123820/14789c35e1913cdd37d6f5e4144ef44499043fba/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775182193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],